---
import TextPage from '../components/TextPage.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
const updated = new Date(SITE.policyUpdated + 'T12:00').toLocaleDateString('en-US', { dateStyle: 'long' });
---
<TextPage title={`Terms of Use | ${SITE.name}`} description={`Terms for using ${SITE.name} calculators, operated by ${SITE.operator}. Results are estimates for general information, not professional advice.`} h1="Terms of use">
  <p><strong>Last updated: {updated}</strong></p>
  <p>These terms apply to your use of {SITE.name} ({new URL(SITE.url).host}), operated by {SITE.operator}. By using the website you agree to them.</p>
  <h2>1. Estimates only</h2>
  <p>All results are estimates provided for general information and education. They are not financial, tax, legal or medical advice. Confirm important figures with a qualified professional or the relevant institution before acting on them.</p>
  <h2>2. No warranty</h2>
  <p>We work hard to keep formulas and data accurate and up to date, but the website is provided “as is” and “as available”, without warranties of any kind, express or implied.</p>
  <h2>3. Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, {SITE.operator} is not liable for any loss or damage arising from your use of, or reliance on, the website or its results.</p>
  <h2>4. Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>You may use and link to our calculators freely. Please don’t scrape the website at high volume, attempt to disrupt it, or republish our content as your own.</p>
  <h2>5. Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>The website’s text, design, charts and code are owned by {SITE.operator} unless stated otherwise. Formulas and public data belong to their respective sources, which we cite.</p>
  <h2>6. Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update these terms. Changes take effect when published on this page with a new date.</p>
  <h2>7. Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these terms: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>. See also our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
</TextPage>
